OL,3,AAsos shoppers sent pop-up message
OL,4,Aapparently from hackers threatening
OL,5,Aretailer
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsos app users have seen a pop-up
OL,8,Fmessage that appears to have been sent
OL,9,Fby hackers - here's what we know so far
OL,11,F"Dear Asos DPO and IT, we have fully
OL,12,Fcompromised the Snowflake instance.
OL,13,FEngage with us, or we will leak it,"
OL,14,Fthe message reads
OL,16,F"Snowflake" refers to a data storage
OL,17,Fcompany, whose popular tools have been
OL,18,Fused by dozens of firms for collecting,
OL,19,Fanalysing and storing data
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
