OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1791291369
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAsos shoppers sent pop-up message
OL,4,Aapparently from hackers threatening
OL,5,Aretailer
OL,6,
OL,7,FDan Bird, from cyber security firm
OL,8,FHorizon3, says the apparent hack seems
OL,9,Fto go beyond Snowflake. Sending the
OL,10,Fmessage "would require access to the
OL,11,Fcompany's notification system, which is
OL,12,Fseparate", he adds
OL,14,FOur reporter asked Asos' chatbot
OL,15,Fwhether her account is compromised -
OL,16,Fthe bot says "we're aware" and
OL,17,F"investigating". Asos is yet to comment
OL,18,Fon the incident
OL,20,FShares in the company are down this
OL,21,Fafternoon following the mass
OL,22,Fnotification
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
